    "name": "DreamEcho",
    "steam_appid": 3226060,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/a7d18499e09a67d3ae967b8acc95120a.avif?t=1752409262\" width=620 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an office worker drifting in a big city, and due to your busy job, you no longer have many friends to stay in touch with. After working tirelessly for an unknown number of days, you have a nightmare ----- a very dark, empty, and cold nightmare. In the dream, there is nothing; it feels as if the entire world consists only of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, a mysterious girl appears. She tells you the story of <strong>Dream Echo</strong>, a story where everyone's dreams are connected together...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up, half in disbelief, with a vague memory of this event. From then on, every time you fall asleep, you find yourself in that dream home, and she is there waiting for you, ready for you both to embark on adventures in the world of <strong>Dream Echo</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/f020a572a355d7f04e532e5a22fbd496.avif?t=1752409262\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/21dd2a4803e6a54ecb15a0d01c5af1fa.avif?t=1752409262\" width=620 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the <strong>Paradise of Concepts</strong>! This game is created by passionate POE fans. There are no specific skill upgrades or fixed combinations in the game; all <strong>skills</strong> are based on fundamental logic, and all <strong>concepts</strong> are modular <strong>blocks</strong> that can be combined freely. How you play is entirely up to the player! The game will continue to update <strong>concepts</strong> in the future until the <strong>Paradise of Concepts</strong> is fully constructed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/950dcdb9591ded0267d667c2ff003065.poster.avif?t=1752409262\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/950dcdb9591ded0267d667c2ff003065.webm?t=1752409262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/2595bf535dae175ba8820ef224acf384.poster.avif?t=1752409262\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/2595bf535dae175ba8820ef224acf384.webm?t=1752409262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/1aa568ff2649a6421cf91d289a09b5b7.poster.avif?t=1752409262\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/1aa568ff2649a6421cf91d289a09b5b7.webm?t=1752409262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/3610c73aa3f80ea4b4e06a96fdc69e66.avif?t=1752409262\" width=620 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every exploration, upon waking from a dream, you can obtain <strong>Memories</strong> by recording your dreams. This allows you to solidify certain concepts, enabling them to take shape quickly during your next venture into the <strong>Dreams</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/fd0aaf5b594d5ace408e96480b07c0d6.avif?t=1752409262\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also decorate and refine your <strong>Memories</strong> in the <strong>Home</strong>, combining them to strengthen and enhance more powerful <strong>Concepts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/2f3f184e1d03c61c75b69e2109538b97.avif?t=1752409262\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even after you leave the game, your character will continue to acquire various <strong>Memories</strong> from &quot;reality&quot;! Once the game officially launches, you'll even be able to exchange <strong>Memories</strong> with your Steam friends! (Stay tuned!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/cf981d13052283ce6b3f55cbecd4e25d.avif?t=1752409262\" width=620 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can freely create a class list using the <strong>Dream Wish List</strong> to craft a build that is uniquely yours, and then share it with other players with just one click. If your <strong>Wish List</strong> is used by others and receives positive feedback, you can earn additional rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are also welcome to join the official QQ discussion group: 805422834</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/a7d18499e09a67d3ae967b8acc95120a.avif?t=1752409262\" width=620 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an office worker drifting in a big city, and due to your busy job, you no longer have many friends to stay in touch with. After working tirelessly for an unknown number of days, you have a nightmare ----- a very dark, empty, and cold nightmare. In the dream, there is nothing; it feels as if the entire world consists only of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, a mysterious girl appears. She tells you the story of <strong>Dream Echo</strong>, a story where everyone's dreams are connected together...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up, half in disbelief, with a vague memory of this event. From then on, every time you fall asleep, you find yourself in that dream home, and she is there waiting for you, ready for you both to embark on adventures in the world of <strong>Dream Echo</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/f020a572a355d7f04e532e5a22fbd496.avif?t=1752409262\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/21dd2a4803e6a54ecb15a0d01c5af1fa.avif?t=1752409262\" width=620 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the <strong>Paradise of Concepts</strong>! This game is created by passionate POE fans. There are no specific skill upgrades or fixed combinations in the game; all <strong>skills</strong> are based on fundamental logic, and all <strong>concepts</strong> are modular <strong>blocks</strong> that can be combined freely. How you play is entirely up to the player! The game will continue to update <strong>concepts</strong> in the future until the <strong>Paradise of Concepts</strong> is fully constructed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/950dcdb9591ded0267d667c2ff003065.poster.avif?t=1752409262\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/950dcdb9591ded0267d667c2ff003065.webm?t=1752409262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/2595bf535dae175ba8820ef224acf384.poster.avif?t=1752409262\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/2595bf535dae175ba8820ef224acf384.webm?t=1752409262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/1aa568ff2649a6421cf91d289a09b5b7.poster.avif?t=1752409262\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/1aa568ff2649a6421cf91d289a09b5b7.webm?t=1752409262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/3610c73aa3f80ea4b4e06a96fdc69e66.avif?t=1752409262\" width=620 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every exploration, upon waking from a dream, you can obtain <strong>Memories</strong> by recording your dreams. This allows you to solidify certain concepts, enabling them to take shape quickly during your next venture into the <strong>Dreams</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/fd0aaf5b594d5ace408e96480b07c0d6.avif?t=1752409262\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also decorate and refine your <strong>Memories</strong> in the <strong>Home</strong>, combining them to strengthen and enhance more powerful <strong>Concepts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/2f3f184e1d03c61c75b69e2109538b97.avif?t=1752409262\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even after you leave the game, your character will continue to acquire various <strong>Memories</strong> from &quot;reality&quot;! Once the game officially launches, you'll even be able to exchange <strong>Memories</strong> with your Steam friends! (Stay tuned!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226060/extras/cf981d13052283ce6b3f55cbecd4e25d.avif?t=1752409262\" width=620 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can freely create a class list using the <strong>Dream Wish List</strong> to craft a build that is uniquely yours, and then share it with other players with just one click. If your <strong>Wish List</strong> is used by others and receives positive feedback, you can earn additional rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are also welcome to join the official QQ discussion group: 805422834</p>",
    "short_description": "Dream Echo is an RogueLite ARPG game where players can explore the world of Dreams and acquire various Concepts to engage in nearly completely free-form combination battles. Additionally, you can gather Memories upon waking, allowing you to bring some Concepts into your next dream adventure...",
